WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:07.372
Parents, here are simple ways to use AI with your kids. Keep personal info private, and sit with young kids.

2
00:00:08.122 --> 00:00:12.300
Step 1. Make up a story together with AI.

3
00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:18.044
Step 2. Use a homework helper that explains, not answers.

4
00:00:18.794 --> 00:00:24.100
Step 3. Check work for copying, and build lessons from class notes.

5
00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:29.940
What to do next? Next, see Watch It, Then Do It, for parents.
